# Select Inbox Project from Go to Command tags the chosen project @inbox, q and gi then use it, and it holds after a restart.
file <<END
INBOX:
	- Call the plumber
Work:
END
keys :
type select inbox project
keys <Enter>
see Inbox Project
type work
keys <Enter>
status Inbox: Work
keys q
see Quick Add → Work
keys <Esc>
restart
keys gi
see 󰋜 › Work
quit
saved <<END
INBOX:
	- Call the plumber
Work: @inbox
END
